{"taskId":"scene-r6-a-pavement","purpose":"铺装反射率、分缝和投影阴影","name":"paving_gain","fields":["photo_y","render_y","confidence"],"specification":"When photo_y/render_y >0 propose confidence interpolation in [0,1] from identity toward bounded photo_y/render_y gain [0.45,1.8], invalid inputs return 1. Provide concrete executable numpy function separating low frequency incident shading from high frequency diffuse granite texture by shared registered pavement support, specifying colour space / high specular exclusions. No alteration to grass. Propose method and rejection for wrongly projected shadows.","sourceRevision":"dcb646220d8055bbcf7aa5176d9f81458b38d298","baselineSceneSha256":"ab5db9bc31ccd5e5de9251fe790b3d1f42232cfccb83ead41e3e58ede8253e96","evidence":{"images":"Photo and R5 product camera 01 registered at 1024×768. Top row overview, bottom detail, columns photo and R5. Training-only frame; do not treat unmasked box statistics as material or segmented branch measurement. Lamp 3.41 m is a scale prior. Single RGB capture cannot determine reflectance independently from incident light.","boxMeasurements":[{"source":"photo 01","xyxy":[0,606,516,768],"medianLinearY":0.188522,"q10q90":[0.028841,0.234398],"meanAbsDx":0.009969},{"source":"photo 01","xyxy":[26,680,344,758],"medianLinearY":0.198742,"q10q90":[0.157491,0.231324],"meanAbsDx":0.012973},{"source":"R5 product 01","xyxy":[0,606,516,768],"medianLinearY":0.526494,"q10q90":[0.026914,0.545085],"meanAbsDx":0.014539},{"source":"R5 product 01","xyxy":[26,680,344,758],"medianLinearY":0.532649,"q10q90":[0.502289,0.543722],"meanAbsDx":0.016055}],"source":[{"path":"infra/reconstruction/calibrate_ground_blender.py","sha256":"6e97aa952f27953a648b9be65bc09e35e45e21249c5de0bbfd55068e62a9f43c","lines":[14,33],"code":"settings = json.loads(config.read_text())
sun, shade = [np.array(settings[k], np.float32) for k in ('sunLinearRgb', 'oldShadeLinearRgb')]
gain = settings['shadeGain']
names = {'Turf.PhotoAlbedo', 'Turf.RegisteredDiffuse'}
count = 0
for ob in scene.objects:
    if ob.type != 'MESH' or not any(m and m.name in names for m in ob.data.materials):
        continue
    if not all(m and m.name in names for m in ob.data.materials):
        raise ValueError('Mixed grass and hardscape')
    layer = ob.data.color_attributes['CapturedIncident']
    rgba = np.empty((len(layer.data), 4), dtype=np.float32)
    layer.data.foreach_get('color', rgba.ravel())
    weight = np.clip((sun[1]-rgba[:, 1]) / (sun[1]-shade[1]), 0, 1)
    rgba[:, :3] = np.clip(rgba[:, :3] + weight[:, None] * shade * (gain-1), 0, 1)
    layer.data.foreach_set('color', rgba.ravel())
    ob.data.update()
    count += 1
if count != 9:
    raise ValueError(f'Expected nine terrain patches, got {count}')"}]},"imageInputs":{"jpegSha256":"94b20b250271b82951eb562e111728ce7913f03f89c34e2b1dc32d3c6f33ac78","sources":[{"source":"photo 01","sha256":"7b31bab3cf0b5873d858b577dd3073a0785d7fe4dea534e9049a259051890ee6","xyxy":[0,606,516,768]},{"source":"photo 01","sha256":"7b31bab3cf0b5873d858b577dd3073a0785d7fe4dea534e9049a259051890ee6","xyxy":[26,680,344,758]},{"source":"R5 product 01","sha256":"344f34d52a0cd2d1e9f3d37eca4713c332260511397d9e396cbfbf9a7b3d84f3","xyxy":[0,606,516,768]},{"source":"R5 product 01","sha256":"344f34d52a0cd2d1e9f3d37eca4713c332260511397d9e396cbfbf9a7b3d84f3","xyxy":[26,680,344,758]}]}}
